  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ういているように　みえる　はなはマントうらの　けの　はんしゃでくきを　カモフラージュしているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "꽃이 떠 있는 것처럼 보이는 것은 망토 뒷면의 털이 빛을 반사해서 줄기를 보이지 않게 하기 때문이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "看似浮在空中的花，是牠利用斗蓬內側的毛的反射將莖隱藏後呈現出的假象。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se sert de la réverbération de la lumière sur la fourrure de sa cape pour camoufler sa tige, ce qui donne l’illusion que sa fleur flotte dans les airs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es erweckt den Eindruck, als würde seine Blume schweben, indem es ihren Stiel mit der Reflexion des Fells an der Innenseite seines Mantels tarnt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se sirve de la luz que reflejan los tricomas de su manto de hojas para camuflar la vid y crear la ilusión óptica de que la flor flota en el aire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I riflessi del pelo all’interno del mantello camuffano lo stelo del suo fiore, che così sembra fluttuare nell’aria.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon uses the reflective fur lining its cape to camouflage the stem of its flower, creating the illusion that the flower is floating.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "浮いているように　見える　花はマント裏の　毛の　反射で茎を　カモフラージュしているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "花看似浮在空中，其实它是通过斗篷内的毛的反射来隐藏住了茎。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se sirve de la luz que reflejan los tricomas de su manto de hojas para camuflar la vid y crear la ilusión óptica de que la flor flota en el aire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "てきの　いしきを　たくみに　そらしかふんが　つまった　はなバクダンをいつのまにか　とりつけ　ばくはする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "교묘하게 상대의 주의를 돌린 뒤 꽃가루가 가득 담긴 꽃폭탄을 눈치채지 못하게 붙여 폭파시킨다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會巧妙引開敵人的注意力，然後引爆牠在神不知鬼不覺間設置好的裝滿花粉的花炸彈。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il détourne habilement l’attention de ses ennemis et disperse subrepticement des bombes florales bourrées de pollen qu’il fait ensuite exploser.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lenkt seine Gegner geschickt ab, um ihnen unbemerkt Blumenbomben voller Pollen unterzuschieben, die es dann explodieren lässt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Después de desviar hábilmente la atención del oponente, le lanza sus bombas florales rellenas de polen y las hace estallar sin que se dé cuenta.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Svia abilmente l’attenzione del nemico e, senza farsi notare, piazza bombe floreali cariche di polline che poi fa esplodere.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "With skillful misdirection, it rigs foes with pollen- packed flower bombs. Meowscarada sets off the bombs before its foes realize what’s going on.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "敵の　意識を　巧みに　そらし花粉が　詰まった　花爆弾をいつの間にか　取りつけ　爆破する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会巧妙地引开敌人的注意力，然后引爆它在神不知鬼不觉间设置好的装满花粉的花炸弹。",
